      "correctAnswer": "d",
      "explanation": "Midpoints: $5, 15, 25$. $\\sum fx = (5 \\times 5) + (15 \\times 8) + (25 \\times 7) = 25 + 120 + 175 = 320$. $\\sum f = 20$. Estimated mean $= \\frac{320}{20} = 16$."
